        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-685 (ensure controlled execution — EAS/RFID Tagging, Source-Tagging &amp; Loss-Prevention Integration (PA-151.3).) | - CTL-685: EAS daily-tested; sensitivity tuned; true alarms routed to response (W4501)
Owner: Loss Prevention (VS-23) / Stores (VS-07) / IT (VS-27)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
