    <bpmn:process id="W_W4498" name="W4498. Source-Tagging &amp; Vendor-Applied EAS/RFID Program" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor contracting (VS-03); tagging-policy update (W4484); cost program
Frequency: Per vendor/category program
Volume: Source-tagged SKUs from ~800–1,000 vendors (high-value categories)
Owner: Auto-ID Lead / LP (VS-23) / Vendor Mgmt (VS-03)
Participants: Procurement (VS-34), Merchandising (VS-01), DC (VS-04), Private Label (VS-41)
Source: workflow W4498 — Source-Tagging &amp; Vendor-Applied EAS/RFID Program</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4498_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4498_Lane1" name="Auto-ID Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4498_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4498_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4498_Lane2" name="DC">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4498_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4498_Lane3" name="Private Label">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4498_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4498_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4498_Start5" name="Vendor contracting (VS-03); tagging-policy update (W4484); cost program">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4498_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4498_Task6" name="Auto-ID Lead/LP/Vendor Mgmt negotiate source-tagging agreements (vendor applies…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Auto-ID Lead/LP/Vendor Mgmt negotiate source-tagging agreements (vendor applies EAS/RFID at manufacture), selecting tag type/encoding per W4484 and reconciling cost (cheaper than in-store application)
Responsible (R): Auto-ID Lead / LP / Vendor Mgmt
Accountable (A): LP Director / VP Merch
Duration: Per vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4498_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4498_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4498_Task7" name="DC/Auto-ID Lead verify source-tags at goods receipt (tag present, correct…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DC/Auto-ID Lead verify source-tags at goods receipt (tag present, correct, read-able) per VS-04, flag missing tags for in-store application (W4492)
Responsible (R): DC / Auto-ID Lead
Accountable (A): DC Manager / LP Director
Duration: Per receipt</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4498_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4498_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4498_Task8" name="Private Label (VS-41) embeds source-tagging into own-brand production spec…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Private Label (VS-41) embeds source-tagging into own-brand production spec; Merchandising tracks source-tag coverage and ROI (W4503)
Responsible (R): Private Label / Merchandising
Accountable (A): VP Merch
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4498_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4498_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4498_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4498_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-685 (ensure controlled execution — EAS/RFID Tagging, Source-Tagging &amp; Loss-Prevention Integration (PA-151.3).) | - CTL-685: source-tag spec in contract; verified at receipt (VS-04); vendor compliance scored (VS-67)
Owner: Auto-ID Lead / LP (VS-23) / Vendor Mgmt (VS-03)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
