    <bpmn:process id="W_W4500" name="W4500. EAS/RFID Tag Detachment, Reuse &amp; Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Sale completion (VS-08); return (VS-32); tag pool replenishment
Frequency: Continuous (per sale/return)
Volume: Reusable hard-tags (EAS) cycled across high-value SKUs
Owner: Stores (VS-07/VS-08) / LP (VS-23)
Participants: POS (VS-08), Returns (VS-32), Auto-ID Lead, DC (VS-04)
Source: workflow W4500 — EAS/RFID Tag Detachment, Reuse &amp; Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4500_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4500_Lane1" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4500_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4500_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4500_Lane2" name="Returns">
