Responsible (R): Returns / Stock Associate
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per return/shift</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4500_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4500_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
