      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4501_Task5" name="LP/Stores respond to EAS alarms per SOP (approach, verify receipt, re-scan)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: LP/Stores respond to EAS alarms per SOP (approach, verify receipt, re-scan), balancing loss prevention with customer dignity and avoiding false detention (legal risk VS-100.3)
Responsible (R): LP Officer / Store Staff
Accountable (A): Store Manager / LP Director
Duration: Per alarm</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4501_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4501_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4501_Task6" name="LP detains/interviews only on confirmed concealment with evidence, following…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: LP detains/interviews only on confirmed concealment with evidence, following lawful-procedure (DOLE/legal), and escalates to police/charges where warranted (links to VS-23 W840 ORC)
Responsible (R): LP / Store Manager
Accountable (A): LP Director / VP Legal
Duration: Per confirmed case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4501_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4501_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4501_Task7" name="LP documents the incident, feeds organized/serial cases to ORC investigation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: LP documents the incident, feeds organized/serial cases to ORC investigation (VS-23 W840/W1542), and reports to Legal (VS-100.3) for prosecution/civil recovery
Responsible (R): LP / Legal
Accountable (A): LP Director / VP Legal
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4501_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
