    <bpmn:process id="W_W4504" name="W4504. Auto-ID Security, Privacy &amp; Fraud-Vector Control" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Fraud incident (VS-23/VS-125); privacy review; audit
Frequency: Continuous + on incident
Volume: Auto-ID fraud-vector control (counterfeit labels, cloned barcodes, tag-switch) enterprise-wide
Owner: LP (VS-23) / Fraud (VS-125) / Auto-ID Lead
Participants: Compliance (VS-22), Privacy (VS-91), IT Security (VS-27.3), Audit (VS-21)
Source: workflow W4504 — Auto-ID Security, Privacy &amp; Fraud-Vector Control</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4504_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4504_Lane1" name="LP">
