        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-150 (ensure labeling &amp; Auto-ID data integrity.) | - CTL-685: anti-counterfeit labeling (VS-71); price-switch fraud controls (VS-23/VS-118); RFID privacy respected (VS-91); practices audited (VS-21)
Owner: LP (VS-23) / Fraud (VS-125) / Auto-ID Lead</bpmn:text>
